"P3372487063" "The Underbosses report directly to the Don, and each has control over a number of Capos. In Paragon City, you don't rise to the top without a little super-powered help, and many Underbosses have heightened abilities or access to specialized gear that helps them stay on top in their cutthroat business."
// DisplayNames :
"P2697289352" "Underboss"

